    &gt;Frances Botsford&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/trevorchase&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Trevor Chase&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jasonlundien&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Jason Lundien&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
